#. "L_PETE_060"
msgid ""
"The only place we could secure the \n"
"equipment was a storm drain.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nous avons caché l'équipement \n"
"dans une bouche d'égout.\n"

#. "L_PETE_061"
msgid ""
"Either of those blocked-up doors will \n"
"do as an escape route.\n"
msgstr ""
"N'importe laquelle de ces portes bloquée \n"
"peut servir de sortie.\n"

#. "L_PETE_062"
msgid ""
"Reprogram that taxi - it's a Mark 2 \n"
"and should be compatible.\n"
msgstr ""
"Reprogrammez ce taxi, c'est un type 2. \n"
"Il devrait être compatible.\n"

#. "L_PETE_063"
msgid ""
"That car park lift is your only \n"
"point of ingress.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cet ascenseur à voiture est votre \n"
"seul point d'entrée.\n"

#. "L_PETE_064"
msgid "EEPROM flag has been set.\n"
msgstr "EEPROM flag has been set.\n"

#. "L_PETE_065"
msgid "EEPROM flag has been cleared.\n"
msgstr "EEPROM flag has been cleared.\n"

#. "L_PETE_066"
msgid "An alternative diversion has been created!\n"
msgstr "Une autre diversion a été créée!\n"

#. "L_PETE_067"
msgid "Tracer Bug has been spotted.\n"
msgstr "Pisteur à été découvert.\n"

#. "L_PETE_068"
msgid ""
"We suspect the G5 Corporation is just a \n"
"front for dataDyne and whoever else is \n"
"involved in this plot. I know Cassandra \n"
"de Vries is going to be here, but I need \n"
"to know who else is attending and what \n"
"they discuss. By the time you get out, \n"
"the help I requested should have arrived.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nous pensons que le G5 n'est qu'une \n"
"couverture de la dataDyne et qu'il est \n"
"impliqué dans ce complot. Je sais que \n"
"Cassandra de Vries sera présente, mais j'ai besoin \n"
"de savoir qui d'autre sera là et de quoi ils \n"
"vont parler. Le temps que vous évacuiez, \n"
"les renforts débarqueront.\n"

#. "L_PETE_069"
msgid ""
"Just who is this help you keep \n"
"referring to?\n"
msgstr ""
"Une cavalerie va venir me sauver... \n"
"A qui avez-vous fait appel?\n"

#. "L_PETE_070"
msgid ""
"Not now, Joanna. Time for radio silence. \n"
"Good luck!\n"
msgstr ""
"Je ne peux rien dire pour l'instant. \n"
"Silence radio! Bonne chance, Joanna!\n"

#. "L_PETE_071"
msgid "Thanks a lot.\n"
msgstr "Merci, chef.\n"

#. "L_PETE_072"
msgid "Remote Mine has been wasted.\n"
msgstr "Mine télécom. gâchée.\n"
